abstract: >-
  An open-source library of structured algorithmic trading skills for AI coding
  agents, in the agentskills.io format, covering broker integration, real-time
  market data architecture, backtesting methodology, financial machine learning,
  risk management, execution algorithms, regulatory compliance, and deployment
  operations. Each skill ships a reference implementation and a unit test suite.
